# 基本文章編集のキーから画面までの時間を、同じ実行の中で比べる (design 11.3), for
# tools/ui_run.py: a text of 200 paragraphs (mkbig doc 200) opened by the desktop's own text
# editor (open, docproc kernel) and by the text editor running as a process (pdoc) in turn,
# three times each, so that both are measured under the same load of the machine. Each time
# the caret is put in the second paragraph and ten letters are typed one at a time, each
# waited for before the next: the desktop's with sync, the process's by its line. Compared:
# "desktop: document key to screen US us" and "document: key to screen US us" (from the key,
# as the keyboard told it, to the window shown; the desktop builds the screen there for the
# line, as the process's wm_obj_flush does), with what each took of it (came, edited, built
# or drawn from), and the process's "drew in" (letters: the calls of the letters). Closed with
# Ctrl+E, which saves what was typed; each round makes its copy again.
# Keys: a..j 04..0d; Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
# round 1
mkbig doc 200
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 800
click 300 170
sync 600
wait 300
logmark
key 04
sync 600
expectsince desktop: document key to screen
wait 200
logmark
key 05
sync 600
expectsince desktop: document key to screen
wait 200
logmark
key 06
sync 600
expectsince desktop: document key to screen
wait 200
logmark
key 07
sync 600
expectsince desktop: document key to screen
wait 200
logmark
key 08
sync 600
expectsince desktop: document key to screen
wait 200
logmark
key 09
sync 600
expectsince desktop: document key to screen
wait 200
logmark
key 0a
sync 600
expectsince desktop: document key to screen
wait 200
logmark
key 0b
sync 600
expectsince desktop: document key to screen
wait 200
logmark
key 0c
sync 600
expectsince desktop: document key to screen
wait 200
logmark
key 0d
sync 600
expectsince desktop: document key to screen
wait 200
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 200
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 200
wait 800
logmark
click 300 170
expectsince document: drew
wait 300
logmark
key 04
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 200
logmark
key 05
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 200
logmark
key 06
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 200
